        "id": "SettQ",
        "name": "Knuckle Down",
        "description": "Sett's next two attacks deal additional damage based off of the target's max health. Sett also gains Move Speed while moving towards enemy champions.",
        "tooltip": "Sett itches for a fight, gaining <span class=\"text-cyan-600 dark:text-cyan-500\">30% Move Speed</span> towards enemy champions for 1.5 seconds.<br /><br />Additionally Sett's next two Attacks deal an additional <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">10/20/30/40/50 plus (1% + (0.01/0.02/0.02/0.03/0.03% Attack Damage)) max Health physical damage</span>.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">The Attacks are always a left and right punch. Deals a max of <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">400 damage</span> to monsters per punch.</span>",
